# .gitignore — Warboss Companion (dev)
#
# This repository is PUBLIC and git history is permanent. Anything committed by
# accident cannot be cleanly removed later. The entries below are the things
# most likely to end up in the folder without being wanted in the repo.

# ─── Game rules — copyrighted, never commit ──────────────────────────────────
# The Kings of War rulebook, FAQ and army lists are Mantic Games' commercially
# published material. Keeping a copy in the working folder is fine; committing
# one is not. See "Game rules" in CLAUDE.md.
*.pdf
*.epub
rules/
rulebook/

# If a PDF ever genuinely belongs in the repo (a diagram, an exported asset),
# add it deliberately with:  git add -f path/to/file.pdf

# ─── Credentials ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# clasp's auth token, if Apps Script sync is ever set up. It normally lives in
# the home directory, not here — this is a backstop against a stray copy.
# (.clasp.json holds only a script ID and IS safe to commit.)
.clasprc.json
.clasprc.json.bak

# Generic secret-shaped files, in case a tool ever writes one here.
.env
.env.*
*.key
*.pem
credentials.json
service-account*.json
client_secret*.json

# ─── Claude Code ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Shared project settings (.claude/settings.json) SHOULD be committed.
# These two are personal to this machine and should not be.
.claude/settings.local.json
CLAUDE.local.md

# ─── Scratch and local working files ─────────────────────────────────────────
# Somewhere to put throwaway scripts, exports and notes without them reaching
# the repo. Create _local/ or _scratch/ and use it freely.
_local/
_scratch/
*.log
*.tmp
*.bak
*.orig

# ─── Tooling ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The app itself has no build step and no dependencies. This is only for
# throwaway scripts (validation, clasp) run inside the repo folder.
node_modules/
package-lock.json
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
venv/

# ─── Editors ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# ─── Operating system ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
.DS_Store?
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
desktop.ini
